  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial aid to all the 47 local government authorities within the seven regions. This decentralised funding is to directly support education quality improvements</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Financial aid to all the 47 local government authorities within the seven regions. This decentralised funding is to directly support education quality improvements is a component of Education Quality Improvement Programme &#x2013; Tanzania (EQUIP-T)  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xa3;33,921,257. It works in the following sector(s): Primary education, Teacher training, Education policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
